[quote="riff.freelance"]

Legacy, Nightmist, Scholar, AZ, and huh I dunno say NW Fixer, AA, or maybe Bunker would be a team that is steping all over each other&#39;s toes.&nbsp;

[/quote]

&nbsp;

Legacy, NightMist, and Scholar on the _fail_ team?! Legacy or Scholar alone would make virtually any team a win team. NightMist is one of my favorites. AZ I&#39;m mixed on, but look at his healing ability. This team has ALL of the healing. And NW Fixer I think would work fantastic w/ Legacy. All you need is to hold off one turn and allow Fixer to get out Dual Crowbars and w/ Galvanize he&#39;s doing 4 and 5 damage every turn. Later in the game Legacy sometimes has relatively unhelpful card plays, which can be used to sacrifice cards to Fixer. AA can do so much! Can make any team powerful. With AZ and NightMist as hitters, AA is going to make them soar. Bunker I tend to agree with you on -- I find him to be on the weaker side in terms of what I&#39;m able to accomplish.

&nbsp;
